title: "Washington Apples: A Curated Dataset of Commercial Varieties, Flavor, Crispness, Skin Color, Harvest, and Origins"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
url: "https://github.com/lightbluetitan/washington-apples"
