abstract: "A curated dataset of 37 commercial apple varieties marketed in Washington State, documenting alphanumeric identifiers (apple_id), variety names (variety_name), flavor profiles (flavor_profile), crispness levels (crispness_level), skin color (skin_color), harvest window (harvest_window), and geographic origin (origin)."
